{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22143","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十四 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有一燕赵士，言貌甚奇瓌。\n日日酒家去，脱衣典数杯。\n问君何落拓，云仆生草莱。\n地寒命且薄，徒抱王佐才。\n岂无济时策，君门乏良媒。\n三献寝不报，迟迟空手回。\n亦有同门生，先升青云梯。\n贵贱交道绝，朱门叩不开。\n及归种禾黍，三岁旱爲灾。\n入山烧黄白，一旦化爲灰。\n蹉跎五十余，生世苦不谐。\n处处去不得，却归酒中来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}